   └─ 实施动作: 实施动作与具体代码修改方案: 将soft_z = tl.where(z > threshold, z, tl.log(1 + tl.exp(z)))和out = (soft_z / beta).to(x.dtype)合并为out = tl.where(x_fp * beta > threshold, x_fp, tl.log(1 + tl.exp(x_fp * beta)) / beta).to(x.dtype)；前提：beta!=0且threshold非负；禁用条件：beta为动态运行时变量时保持原写法**

